<article class="page-faq">
  <header class="page-hero">
    <div style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 6px;">❓</div>
    <h1 class="page-hero-title">Holiday &amp; Parent FAQ</h1>
    <p class="page-hero-sub">Delivery deadlines, international plug safety, and teen gadget certifications.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="page-content-wrapper">
    <div class="pdp-accordions" data-accordion-single>
      <!-- FAQ 1: Guaranteed Delivery Date -->
      <div class="accordion-item is-open reveal-on-scroll">
        <button type="button" class="accordion-trigger">
          <div class="accordion-title-wrap">
            <span>🎄</span>
            <span>Will my order arrive before Christmas Day?</span>
          </div>
          <span class="accordion-icon-toggle">▼</span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-body" style="max-height: 200px;">
          <p>
            <strong>Yes!</strong> All orders placed on or before our stated cutoff date (December 15–18 depending on destination country) are backed by our 100% Christmas Arrival Guarantee. If your package doesn't reach your address by December 24, we will refund your full shipping cost and send you a $25 gift card.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 2: Power and Plug Adapters -->
      <div class="accordion-item reveal-on-scroll delay-1">
        <button type="button" class="accordion-trigger">
          <div class="accordion-title-wrap">
            <span>🔌</span>
            <span>Do these electronic gadgets work with UK / EU / AU / US power outlets?</span>
          </div>
          <span class="accordion-icon-toggle">▼</span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-body">
          <p>
            <strong>Yes, universally compatible!</strong> 95% of our gadgets operate over universal USB-C or standard 5V USB power cables that plug into any phone wall charger or laptop. For AC wall powered gadgets (like the Levitating Orb Lamp), we automatically include a region-matched AC adapter (US 110V, UK 230V 3-pin, EU 230V 2-pin, or AU angled plug) based on your shipping address.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 3: Product Safety & Child Certification -->
      <div class="accordion-item reveal-on-scroll delay-2">
        <button type="button" class="accordion-trigger">
          <div class="accordion-title-wrap">
            <span>🛡️</span>
            <span>Are these gadgets safe for teens and tweens (ages 10–16)?</span>
          </div>
          <span class="accordion-icon-toggle">▼</span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-body">
          <p>
            <strong>Strictly safety-tested:</strong> Every product in our catalog undergoes rigorous compliance testing and holds official CE, FCC, RoHS, and UKCA safety marks. We use shatter-resistant materials, non-toxic finishes, and low-voltage cool-to-touch LEDs so items are safe to leave powered on in bedrooms.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 4: Surprise Customs Charges -->
      <div class="accordion-item reveal-on-scroll delay-3">
        <button type="button" class="accordion-trigger">
          <div class="accordion-title-wrap">
            <span>💰</span>
            <span>Will the recipient or I have to pay any customs duty or VAT?</span>
          </div>
          <span class="accordion-icon-toggle">▼</span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-body">
          <p>
            <strong>Zero surprise fees:</strong> We ship Delivered Duty Paid (DDP). All sales tax, VAT, and international import tariffs are settled upfront by us during dispatch. You and the recipient will never be asked for additional payment by the delivery driver.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 5: Returns & Duplicate Gifts -->
      <div class="accordion-item reveal-on-scroll delay-4">
        <button type="button" class="accordion-trigger">
          <div class="accordion-title-wrap">
            <span>🔄</span>
            <span>What if my teen receives duplicate gifts or wants a different color?</span>
          </div>
          <span class="accordion-icon-toggle">▼</span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-body">
          <p>
            Our extended holiday return window runs all the way through <strong>January 31, 2027</strong>. You or the gift recipient can initiate an exchange or return for any unopened item with free return drop-off available in 15+ countries.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
